    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey sorry its so late but my 4yo is burning up and he's so cranky. he weighs 36lbs and i found this bottle of acetaminophen in the cabinet but i cant tell if it's the infant one or the kids one... wait it says 160mg per 5ml. i really dont want to call the doctor at this hour and wake them up if it's not an emergency. can u just tell me exactly how many ml i should give him for his weight? i just need a quick number so he can sleep.",
